r agent could provide evidence that A or D possess strong, documented stress\u2011management and decisive leadership that outweigh their interpersonal drawbacks, or if B\u2019s communication issues are shown to be severe enough to jeopardize safety, I would reconsider.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
