tainty:** The actual impact of C\u2019s communication challenges and egocentricity on crew coordination during long\u2011haul flights \u2013 whether they could lead to miscommunication in critical phases.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication problems regularly cause crew conflict or safety\u2011critical miscommunication, or strong evidence that A or D possess proven stress\u2011resilience and decisive leadership that outweigh their interpersonal drawbacks.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
